body:
Currently, CBC is listed as "approved" in the appendix. Shall we list if as "legacy" on the ground that you should use more modern solutions such as GCM?

For example, [ciphersuite.info](https://ciphersuite.info/) lists all CBC TLS  ciphersuites either as "weak" or as "insecure". Can we generalize this to other usages of CBC?

@unprovable, @danielcuthbert, @jmanico
